# GYAM TypeScript

- Prefer explicit types at API boundaries; avoid `any`.
- Validate all external input (PIN, task IDs, job fields, upload metadata).
- Hash PINs; never log PINs, session tokens, or SMTP credentials.
- Timer truth: elapsed time excludes paused gaps; auto-pause after 60s unanswered keep-alive.
- Rollover: unfinished prior day blocks today until cleared.
- Job board columns only: `Wishlist | Applied | Interview | Accepted | Rejected`.
- Email V1: copy/paste primary; optional file attach; do not rely on PDF OCR.
- Prefer small pure helpers for duration math, quota math, and roadmap day mapping.
- Colocate UI with feature folders; keep API routes thin; put domain logic in services.
- Dark theme via CSS variables; avoid purple-glow / generic AI aesthetic defaults.
